brand_book    colors, fonts, logos, layouts, usage rules
warehouse     ads + analytics + sales + content accounts
              spend, clicks, leads, conversions, results
              query by campaign / asset / date
              include period + metric definitions

AGENT LOOP
1 read    brief + customer + offer + voice + proof + prior results
2 read    brand book + visual refs
3 create  draft + self-check against checks.md
4 review  you: claims, offer, voice, design, links
5 revise  from feedback
6 ship    publish → collect results
7 write   edits back to voice.md / examples / warehouse / moodboard

RULES
store markdown in GitHub
link large creatives from shared storage
start with one function + one live task
update files from real work (corrections, new objections, offer changes)
